CAVE-Mem

This distribution includes code derived from Proactive Memory Agent
(https://github.com/yifannnwu/proactive-memory-agent, revision 89e5c0d).
CAVE-Mem adds its own replay, memory admission, data collection, and policy
modules and modifies packaging, configuration, runner, and task adapters.

The vendored external/harbor package is derived from Harbor
(https://github.com/harbor-framework/harbor). See its accompanying license.

